  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Carter monsters sling bag adapts effortlessly to your routine, giving you the option to wear it as a crossbody with a 24-inch strap drop. A zip closure and interior slip pocket keep essentials organized and close at hand, making this everyday style a practical choice for travel or casual plans. Crafted from fabric, it brings lightweight durability to your collection.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Adjustable crossbody strap with 24&quot; drop at longest</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 1 slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 12&quot; (L) x 8&quot; (H) x 2.4&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
